330","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2559520/384f9cb465f1850aac9f29912f15f681756b5214/ss_384f9cb465f1850aac9f29912f15f681756b5214.600x338.jpg?t=1740576330"}],"short_description":"Bony Bones Adventures - is a 3D platformer where the lands of Zagrobiya have been enslaved by a necromancer. Help those in need, drive away the invaders, become a hero of Zagrobiya and return its freedom.","steam_appid":2559520,"support_info":{"email":"makeonlytruegames@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}